 modeling_natlas.py | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 configuration_natlas.py | 6 ++++++
 tokenization_natlas.py  | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 89 insertions(+)

